    ('DSR','2023','2.25(a)','2.0','2.0 EARTH WORK','Excavating, supplying, stacking and filling of local earth (including royalty) by mechanical transport upto a lead of 5km also including ramming and watering of the earth in layers not exceeding 20 cm in foundation trenches, plinth, sides of foundation etc. complete for all lift.','cum',700.50,true),
